      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e_2_343x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"brncF546Gj50ZD2IIoe1iWNBVPE\" width=\"343\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e_2_343x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/503013f693b323aeb3bfb81354eff8495912300e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">368×536 24.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In the form view, the <strong>Actions</strong> button shows only the valid workflow actions, with the correct confirmations and error messages.<br>\nIn the list view, however, extra actions appear (including invisible buttons), some don’t work until the page is refreshed, and there are no confirmation messages.</p>\n<p>I’ve tried modifying <code>list.js</code>, but it doesn’t fix the issue.<br>\n<strong>Question:</strong> Is there a recommended way to make the list view <strong>Actions</strong> button follow the same behavior as in the form view?</p>",
